# Stripe

- Server Stripe SDK: `@/lib/stripe/server` and `@/lib/stripe/admin`.
- Checkout start: `@/lib/stripe/start-checkout`. Session reconcile: `@/lib/stripe/reconcile-session`.
- Keep webhook and cron handlers idempotent. Do not log full payloads or secret keys.
- Ignore `stripe.exe` in the repo root.
